            {
              "id": "zoom-activity-logs-2",
              "definition": {
                "type": "note",
                "content": "**Zoom** is a video meeting and collaboration platform. This dashboard reads its Reports API (source `zoom`): who signed in and out from which clients and IPs, and what the account's admins changed (users, settings, roles, recordings).\n\nConnect an account in [Integrations → Zoom Activity Logs](/integrations/connectors/zoom-activity-logs) with a Server-to-Server OAuth app.",
